						"type": "bool",
						"value": false
					},
					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: QUANTIZING A SINE WAVE\n\nIn this example we’re taking a sine wave oscillator and quantizing its values into discrete steps of 0.25 resulting in a choppy, but sine-like motion."
					}
				},
